    "title": "Strong to severe thunderstorms across the Columbia Basin Thursday afternoon/evening - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sigmund Seroka Weather Anchor ,\n7 hours ago The Storm Prediction Center has issued a slight risk (Level 2) for the Columbia Basin in Northeastern Oregon and Southeastern/South Central Washington for Thursday evening. Strong to severe thunderstorms with damaging wind gusts 40-60 MPH and hail up to 1\" in diameter is expected through the afternoon and evening (3 P.M. to 9 P.M.). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
